<!--
    Afrikaans (Requirement 7).

    Translated for meaning rather than word for word, because several of the English strings are
    idiomatic. "Mark taken" becomes "Gemerk geneem" rather than a literal rendering, and the
    offline wording avoids the English habit of turning nouns into verbs.

    These should be read by a first-language speaker before submission. The developer is not one,
    and a medication app is the wrong place for a translation nobody has checked.
-->
